# Money Display

## Format Requirements

- Always display amounts in the format `[number]₫` (e.g., `1.234₫`).
- Use dot (`.`) as the thousands separator.
- Do not display any decimal places.
- If decimals exist, round to the nearest whole number.

## Money Input Constraints

- Money input fields must allow a maximum of 10 characters.
